5c8e7315566b18dfaeb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d52b2a1d/uploads/origins/1475202f-fe79-4759-897d-bdd2baa778ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72b1a66fdd30908e9acfc4362d7a12b3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のキツネの女の子、テンコのアートをお願いしたいです。彼女はキツネの女帝であり、アストラル魔法を操る。その力は非常に大きく、彼女は輝くような光を放ち、まるで肌が水晶であるかのようにその光を屈折させているように見える。白い剣、金の鏡、9つのルビーの勾玉を操る。これらはすべてアストラル魔術で飽和した水晶でできている。また、虹色の炎を出すことができ、その炎を不死鳥の翼に見立てたこともある。アストラルの魔法で世界の意思に縛られ、常に恍惚の中にいる。トランス状態の深さは、アストラル魔法をどれだけ使っているかによって決まる。\n\n好きなように描いてください。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/A8vFbFC", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tetetetetetet_a/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/78fa4175/uploads/origins/034257f1-1b4b-461e-80c2-d3c36ecd9f23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca5de9e02f795bf17f2351c2ca677a33", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/78fa4175/uploads/origins/034257f1-1b4b-461e-80c2-d3c36ecd9f23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca5de9e02f795bf17f2351c2ca677a33, https://si.imgix.net/78fa4175/uploads/origins/034257f1-1b4b-461e-80c2-d3c36ecd9f23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6743e17a97dfb16f56e09620466238b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/78fa4175/uploads/origins/034257f1-1b4b-461e-80c2-d3c36ecd9f23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c980d7b98ef418f1a022d7f4e090524c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Ichio!! I was wondering if I could order a piece for my partner of their OC? 😊💕\n\nMichael: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1sqFYnBbGPff0qF1blNI3U33C29WuX_Iy\n\nCould you please draw an outfit similar to the one in the Outfit Inspiration folder? You can have full creative liberty to make it how you want! \n\nAnd in the Shackles Reference folder, could you please add the red effects in some type of way? I'd love to leave the rest to you!\n\nThank you as always for these wonderful opportunities!! 🥰💕", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tetetetetetet_a/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/931d62d8/uploads/origins/e35ac611-ca88-4ae3-96c2-3edc7f50af54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=679ec2b94534db5ebe0f7dc880fc11e7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/931d62d8/uploads/origins/e35ac611-ca88-4ae3-96c2-3edc7f50af54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=679ec2b94534db5ebe0f7dc880fc11e7, https://si.imgix.net/931d62d8/uploads/origins/e35ac611-ca88-4ae3-96c2-3edc7f50af54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c6e7ee403171f6e1cdcfc96b327afc10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/931d62d8/uploads/origins/e35ac611-ca88-4ae3-96c2-3edc7f50af54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=04bf6b2a99587f414b679a290d7fb2fd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tetetetetetet_a/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bdf5a467/uploads/origins/54ecd891-3f88-416b-aec0-1b07d368f640?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cdbfafe8e6cb9ebca3d7e43c7ee7158", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bdf5a467/uploads/origins/54ecd891-3f88-416b-aec0-1b07d368f640?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cdbfafe8e6cb9ebca3d7e43c7ee7158, https://si.imgix.net/bdf5a467/uploads/origins/54ecd891-3f88-416b-aec0-1b07d368f640?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2